38185>>>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38188>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38188>>>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38188>>>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38188>>>>>        Handle hoDD
38188>>>>>
38188>>>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38189>>>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38190>>>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38191>>>>>
38191>>>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38191>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38192>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38193>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
38194>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
38195>>>>>
38195>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
38197>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
38198>>>>>        End
38198>>>>>>
38198>>>>>        Else Begin
38199>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38200>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38201>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38202>>>>>        End
38202>>>>>>
38202>>>>>    End_Procedure
